      "message": "I think passing in coords to these functions is the right direction, but I am not sure the \u0027dev2Local\u0027 matrix should be included in every helper function.\n\nThe dev2Local matrix should be used once at the root to convert sk_FragCoord to the initial local coords, and then every level within the shader tree should just transform the coords as needed (concat a local matrix, or use an explicit formula override, etc).",
