      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t think applying the dev2Local at the beginning of main() would give the same results as applying it at the end, after all the local-matrices have been applied. It seems like it would give a different results (matrix-mult is non-commutative). But it definitely makes my life much easier if we can do it once at the front of main(). Please explain.",
